				<r3d:description language="eng">The Malaysia Open Science Platform is an initiative by the Academy of Sciences Malaysia in collaboration with the Malaysian Ministry of Science, Technology and Innovation that aims to collect and consolidate Malaysian research data in a trusted platform. MOSP acts as a metadata harvester for research data that is deposited in institutional repositories. MOSP is now currently connected to 9 repositories (higher learning institutes and government agencies) and is planning to connect to more.</r3d:description>
